            "review_title": "Review at Bia Sanh Dieu",
            "review_text": "winter\nHanoi, Vietnam612 contributions\n0\nNice bar with friendly staff\nJul 2019 • Couples\nBia Sanh Dieu will, unfortunately, be quite far out of the way for many residents of Hanoi, but for beer lovers, it’s worth making a trip out. This pub definitely feels like it’s marketed towards rich locals, though there are a number of Korean and Japanese residences nearby, so I imagine they may frequent Bia Sanh Dieu also. They have over 15 beers on tap (impressive!) including four excellent in-house brews. Their food menu offers a good range of gourmet options. The staff were friendly and the restaurant was clean, comfortable with good AC. Well worth a stop if you’re in the area!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 18, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
