            "review_text": "Kristina\nNghe An Province, Vietnam23 contributions\n0\nWhat an amazing beer in Hanoi\nFeb 2019 • Friends\nI had a short trip to Ha Noi last month. When I wandered in a small street in Cau Giay district, I was discovery this amazing beerhouse. This is the first time I try one of the beers like this. To be honest, I was fallen in love with it for the first drink. I never try some things like this before. What an amazing discovery. I'll back here any time I have a chance. Highly recommendation.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 6, 2019",
